#ASSERT `s 47(a) — the day on which the amount of the sanction is updated` (YMD 2026 12 20) FALSE (JUST (YMD 2027 1 19)) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 12 20)
#ASSERT `s 47(b) — the amount of` 20_000 `updated on` (YMD 2026 12 20) `, the first update being in` 2026 `and the index readings being` `the index readings` EQUALS 20_340
#ASSERT `s 47(b) — the amount of` 20_000 `updated on` (YMD 2027 1 19) `, the first update being in` 2026 `and the index readings being` `the index readings` EQUALS 20_680

